{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"cypher","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Cypher","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Cypher (.cypher .cyp .cql).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"cypher","name":"Cypher","extensions":[".cypher",".cyp",".cql"],"grammar":"grammars/cypher.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Cypher","path":"snippets/cypher.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/cypher.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"-\\\\[|\\\\]->|<-\\\\[|\\\\]-|-->|<--|--\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*(?=\\\\s*:(?!:))\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:CONSTRAINT|OPTIONAL|CONTAINS|DISTINCT|PERIODIC|FOREACH|HEADERS|RETURN|UNWIND|CREATE|DELETE|DETACH|REMOVE|STARTS|EXISTS|UNIQUE|ASSERT|COMMIT|MATCH|WHERE|MERGE|ORDER|LIMIT|UNION|YIELD|INDEX|USING|WITH|SKIP|ENDS|CASE|WHEN|THEN|ELSE|CALL|LOAD|FROM|DESC|SET|ALL|AND|NOT|XOR|END|CSV|ASC|BY|AS|OR|IN|IS|ON)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:relationships|properties|toInteger|timestamp|coalesce|toString|datetime|collect|toFloat|length|labels|count|nodes|range|size|type|head|last|tail|keys|date|sum|avg|min|max|id)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/cypher.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Match\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"match\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"MATCH (${1:n}:${2:Label})\",\n      \"WHERE ${1:n}.${3:prop} = ${4:value}\",\n      \"RETURN ${1:n}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"MATCH ... RETURN\"\n  },\n  \"Create node\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"create\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"CREATE (${1:n}:${2:Label} {${3:name}: \\\"${4:value}\\\"})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"CREATE a node\"\n  },\n  \"Relationship\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"MATCH (${1:a})-[${2:r}:${3:REL}]->(${4:b})\",\n      \"RETURN ${1:a}, ${2:r}, ${4:b}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"MATCH a relationship\"\n  },\n  \"Merge\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"merge\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"MERGE (${1:n}:${2:Label} {${3:id}: ${4:\\\\$id}})\",\n      \"ON CREATE SET ${1:n}.created = timestamp()\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"MERGE\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Cypher\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Cypher.\n\n## Files\n\n`.cypher`, `.cyp`, `.cql`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `match` | MATCH ... RETURN |\n| `create` | CREATE a node |\n| `rel` | MATCH a relationship |\n| `merge` | MERGE |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}